// chriz-iwd-encounters 330: Gorg has turned hostile (CIE_JOR_GORG 1, set by his
// script): the wolves of his pack turn hostile and come to him (on top of the area
// script). They turn here, not through their team script: in the lab far wolves did
// not run their scripts and stayed neutral on the way. CIE_JOR_GORG (area): 2 the
// pack has been sent.

IF
  Global("CIE_JOR_GORG","MYAREA",1)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CIE_JOR_GORG","MYAREA",2)%cie_jor_pack%
    Continue()
END
